WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.070
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.190
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.880
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.390
Joie of Neo, the third power player,

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:15.180
and Teppei, whose personality was changed 
by his power, appeared at the Fest.

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:18.950
Joie turned out to be the spitting 
image of the legendary chef, Froese.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.350
She overwhelmed Jiro and 
Setsuno with her power.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:30.470
Meanwhile, Toriko and Starjun, who 
sensed the threat that Joie posed,

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:34.140
postponed the rest of their 
battle and headed for her!

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:42.170
The Beginning of the End! Toriko vs. Joie!

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:49.780
You...

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:53.850
Please, stop!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:57.960
Why do Toriko-san and 
Teppei-san have to fight?!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.590
You're only wasting your breath.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:05.700
He's not the same person anymore.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.780
At any rate,

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:11.440
he's strong enough to make a meal out of 
Zebra of the Four Kings in an instant.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.670
I'll eliminate anyone who gets in my way.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.840
Move, Teppei!

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:21.910
Binding Tree.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.520
Toriko-san!

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.220
What intense pressure! What is this?!

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:39.600
I'm surprised your Binding Tree 
is still hidden underground.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:42.730
I'll take care of this one.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.370
Granny Setsu!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.760
We can't be beaten.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:54.610
And now I need to punish you a little.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:58.370
Master Jiro and Setsuno, 
the National Treasure...

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:03.790
Even you two won't be able 
to take him down that easily.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.140
Your opponent is me!

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:16.030
That's the image of your Gourmet Cells,

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.820
which indicates a robust, 
savory taste, but...

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:30.000
W-What was that?!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.300
That determination...

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:36.850
It's enough to make enemies 
of both Gourmet Corp. and IGO!

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.440
I have no business with you and yours.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.260
What I want is...

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.800
...that chef.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:45.960
What?!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.730
M-Me?!

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.440
Not on your life!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.610
I won't let you lay a finger on Komatsu!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.040
Flying Nail Gun!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.020
Blazing Whirlwind!

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:19.840
Just one slight move of her knife

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:20.930
extinguished the flames!

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:23.740
Not only the flames...

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:34.080
What do you think of Cinderella's sharpness?

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:37.050
C-Cinderella?!

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.190
You don't mean...

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.020
...the knife of Froese,

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:42.060
the God Chef?!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:46.000
Yeesh. Who are we dealin' with here?

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:50.090
I can't even imagine beatin' her!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.280
I wonder how long it's been 
since I last used Chopsticks...

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.240
It seems the Human World is in chaos, too.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.910
I have to settle things here quickly.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.210
No more playing, Midora!

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:16.680
Old man... Become my prey!

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:22.900
Right now, everything 
under the sun is my prey!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.860
Hungry Tongue!

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.810
It's bad manners to lick one's chopsticks.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.900
Your appetite is the same as ever.

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:59.820
But to even eat my Chopsticks?

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.830
All this reminds me...

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.680
...of long ago.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:11.080
We often exchanged blows during 
our training, didn't we?

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:14.880
Memories do nothing to satisfy hunger.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:20.840
I threw the past away a long time ago.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.270
There he is! Over here!

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.100
Thieving again!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:44.540
I possessed special abilities 
ever since I was born,

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.520
but people treated me as 
if I were less than human.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:54.960
During the long world war, 
when ingredients were scarce

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:58.440
and there was no distribution of food,

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:00.190
I was forced to steal.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:04.660
I remember being beaten to within an 
inch of my life when I was very young

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:13.650
and being so hungry that 
I lost consciousness.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:43.530
Good. You're awake.

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:47.690
You're so emaciated that you had me worried.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.440
Here, have some.

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.750
I'm Froese.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:56.940
I'm a chef.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.720
So I have a little confidence in the taste...

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.510
Go ahead.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:04.230
I'm... hungry...

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.350
Delicious...

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:18.190
I'm glad.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.560
If you've got no place to go,

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.410
you can stay here as long as you like.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:41.810
Let go!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.880
What's with this kid?

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.420
Stop it. That boy's a new 
member of this family.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.130
Family...?

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.950
Let go of him, Ichiryu.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.730
Certainly, Acacia-sama.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:59.930
You don't have to be afraid.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:06.820
You eat so dynamically.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.950
It's like you're a wild animal.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.500
Jiro.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.350
You're not so different.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.530
Neither are you, Ichiryu.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:16.860
Even though he was emaciated,

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:20.620
drinking just one spoonful 
of soup healed his wounds.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.440
Yeah. Just like the rest of us,

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.660
it seems he has Gourmet Cells.

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:29.610
I didn't catch your name.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.380
I don't gotta name.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:34.170
I've been alone ever since I was born.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:35.980
That right?

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.620
That's similar to us too.

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.650
We were taken in, just like you.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:44.590
Even without any ingredients 
around, you clung to life.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:49.000
I'm responsible for the 
war going on like this.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:55.000
I must find GOD soon...

00:10:57.180 --> 00:11:01.220
Say, Acacia, we'd better decide 
on a name for this boy.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.510
We <i>are</i> his family.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:03.640
That's right.

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:09.390
The eldest is Ichiryu, or in 
other words, "first dragon".

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.750
The middle is Jiro, or "second wolf".

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:13.980
Then he should be "Saburo", huh?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.450
Why would he be that?!

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:17.810
A tiger...

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:21.890
"Third tiger"... His name will be "Midora".

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:24.000
That's a nice name.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.100
Go on, eat up, Midora.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:29.290
Midora...

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:40.290
Welcome home.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.020
This is Setsuno, my new partner.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.620
Partner?!

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.800
For the first time, it felt like

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:07.300
my stomach, and my heart, were full.

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:09.760
But...

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:13.410
...everything was taken away that day...

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:18.050
Welcome home, Acacia.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:28.040
It seems the Gourmet Solar 
Eclipse is going to occur soon.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.320
GOD is going to appear.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.080
Froese...

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.480
Your power is needed...

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.240
...to cook GOD.

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.010
Yes.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.060
I understand.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.280
But...

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.690
...it's dangerous to travel 
in search of GOD, isn't it?!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.080
Even so, I have to go.

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:07.370
I'm going to fill the stomachs 
of everyone on Earth.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.780
To end the war...

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:15.640
For their sake! Why?!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:19.180
What's this aura?!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.880
The key to GOD... Blue Nitro!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.590
Have they all come for us?

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:30.920
Don't do anything!

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.440
Nobody can beat them.

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.430
It's time to go, Froese.

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:38.010
Yes.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.580
Right after their departure,

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.370
the Gourmet Eclipse took place.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:05.520
And some time after the 
Gourmet Eclipse was over,

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.900
they returned.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.260
Froese!

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:22.960
Where are Acacia, Ichiryu, and Jiro?

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.560
They went off to get ingredients 
that will help you.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.450
Oh...

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:28.410
What in the world happened?

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:32.880
I cooked an ingredient I wasn't used to.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:34.050
You mean...

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.790
That's right. GOD.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:41.370
Now the empty stomachs of people 
all over the world can be filled.

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:44.710
But why do you have to 
be sacrificed for that?!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.200
For <i>their</i> sake?!

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:50.760
That's it! Healing Water!

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:54.810
Before, Acacia's used it to heal my wounds.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:57.690
I'm sure that Healing Water will restore you!

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.630
No! It's too dangerous!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.750
Wait here. I'll be back soon.

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:06.690
Midora!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:10.960
But Healing Water...

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:17.770
...was protected by Deros, the Dragon King.

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:26.170
Sorry... it took me so long...

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.080
This should help you...

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.140
Midora!

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:37.780
If you're going to act for the 
sake of everyone in the world,

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:42.430
I'm going to act for your sake!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.260
Your sake, for the rest of my life...

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:48.770
At this rate, Midora will...

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.260
That dark technique...

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:53.660
Dark Art...

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.320
God's cooking technique!

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.600
God Cooking!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.910
Don't! Not in your condition!

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:06.010
My cooking will heal you up fast.

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:09.250
You're pushing yourself too far, Froese!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:15.940
I...

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:20.230
I...

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:26.060
...just wanted to help her!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.940
Froese...

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:38.260
Forgive me for going off on a 
journey and leaving you behind.

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.580
Continuing to live...

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.250
...means continuing to eat.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:48.290
We take lives.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:54.230
Nature is always sharing life with us.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.940
That's why we share.

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:00.200
Food... Our lives...

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.330
Ichiryu...

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.210
Jiro...

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.460
Setsu...

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:07.970
Midora...

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:13.140
All of you must live for Froese.

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:21.810
The war ended shortly after that.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.720
And then...

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:26.560
...the Gourmet Age began.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:29.030
Everyone's hunger was satisfied.

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.630
Again and again,

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:38.190
I poured Healing Water on Froese's grave,

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:40.940
but it didn't bring her back to life.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.060
Ever since I lost Froese,

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:50.350
my stomach... and my heart... 
have never been full!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.370
After Froese-sama passed away,

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:57.810
we were told that Acacia-sama sealed 
away both GOD and his Full Course.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:01.690
And yet, why do you disobey his orders?

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:04.060
Acacia told us...

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.100
"Live for Froese."

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:09.700
In that case, I alone will devour

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:13.570
GOD and all of the ingredients in this world!

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:16.880
I'll consume your life too!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.710
You don't understand?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.240
Then I have no choice.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.890
Secret Technique!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.920
Two Chopsticks as One!

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:29.720
Farewell,

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.020
my little brother.

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:37.230
Wha...?!

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:41.670
You must be senile. Didn't you notice?

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:44.590
Hungry Tongue swallows up not only objects,

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.500
but space as well.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.140
What is this?!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.800
The space surrounding us

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.580
is already mine!

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:56.460
Hungry Space!

00:18:56.460 --> 00:19:00.120
Everything in this space is my food!

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:08.590
You're not goin' anywhere!

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.500
You still have fight left in you?

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.940
Satan Slash!

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.250
You leave my...

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.210
...partner alone!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.650
Even though he's your partner,

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.890
it seems you don't understand 
his value at all.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:45.990
You found the old recipe book in 
the Gourmet Pyramid, didn't you?

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:52.970
You're after that old book?

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:55.340
That isn't all I want.

00:19:55.950 --> 00:20:00.280
It takes incomparable 
Gourmet Luck to find that.

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:04.520
No one could have arrived at <i>that recipe</i>,

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:07.230
but you did.

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:10.520
I need your Gourmet Luck.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.760
To acquire GOD, you see...

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.830
You're coming with me.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.470
K-Komatsu!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:29.070
Voice Missile!

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:38.350
Zebra-san!

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:41.030
That tree was cocky!

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:43.990
It took me time to cut through it.

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:46.990
And are you strolling over 
here to be turned into food?

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:50.130
You should have just quietly stayed put.

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.360
Poison Rifle!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.940
Hair Punch!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.370
Sorry we're late.

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.910
The headliner always appears at the end.

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:14.620
Zebra! Coco! Sunny!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.020
Hey, just sit back down.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:19.390
Your turn is over, Toriko.

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:21.250
Don't talk stupid.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.570
I made a promise...

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:26.340
...to protect Komatsu!

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:33.500
Well, well. All Four Kings are here.

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:38.080
This is perfect.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:41.990
I'll cook all of you up in no time.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:57.200
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:02.760
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:08.460
